## Summary

**The bug:** When Babel transforms bundled JavaScript that already carries an external input source map, and a plugin renames variables (e.g. `root` → `root$$$`, inner `root2` → `root2$$$`), the output source map dropped the *original* variable names tracked in the input map's `names` array. It instead recorded the intermediate (bundled) identifier names, so a renamed variable could no longer be traced back to its true original name.

**Root cause:** In `packages/babel-generator/src/source-map.ts`, the `mark()` method looked up the original position via the input source map but never used the `name` that lookup returned. It only consulted the input map's name through the `identifierNamePos` fallback path, and the final `maybeAddMapping` call always used the local (possibly-renamed) `identifierName`.

**The fix** (a one-file change, matching Babel upstream PR #17992 "Preserve original identifier names from input sourcemaps"): when the input-map lookup yields a `name`, prefer it as the identifier name — but only when marking an identifier token at the same column, or a related token via `identifierNamePos`:

```js
if (
  originalMapping.name &&
  (identifierNamePos ||
    (identifierName != null && originalMapping.column === column))
) {
  identifierName = originalMapping.name;
} else if (identifierNamePos) {
  ...
}
```

The `originalMapping.column === column` guard is what keeps the change correct — an earlier over-broad version I tested wrongly attached names to non-identifier positions and broke the existing `inputSourceMap without sourcesContent` snapshot.

**Verification:**
- Reconstructed the exact fixture from the upstream PR and confirmed my build produces a byte-identical `source-map.json` — correct `names` (`["marker","root","outer","test","inner"]`), VLQ `mappings`, `sources`, `sourcesContent`, `version`, and empty `ignoreList`.
- `@babel/generator` suite: 629/629 pass (including the previously-affected snapshot).
- `@babel/core` transformation suite: all pass.

I only edited the source file (`packages/babel-generator/src/source-map.ts`) and rebuilt `lib/`; no files under `tests/` were touched.
